      "title": "Criminal trespass arrest: Jennifer Morgan Lofrano",
      "body": [
        "Jennifer Morgan Lofrano, 41, was arrested on a charge of criminal trespass in the second degree — entering or remaining on premises without permission — recorded by police as a misdemeanor.",
        "900 block of Old Steese Highway, Fairbanks, Oct. 31 at 2:27 p.m.; Fairbanks Police. Police case 26003325.",
        "No charging document had been filed in the Alaska Court System as of the morning of Nov. 1, so no court case number or court date exists for the arrest."
      ],
